    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">GST e-Way Bill:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The Goods and Services Tax (GST) e-Way Bill is a mandatory document required for inter-state transportation of goods. It ensures the smooth movement of goods by providing necessary information about the consignment, such as the sender's and receiver's addresses, goods details, and GSTIN (Goods and Services Tax Identification Number).</p>
