  </div>
</div>

<p>When hiring packers and movers, it is essential to understand the available risk coverage options:</p>

<ul>
<li><strong>Parcel Services:</strong> Parcel services offer limited coverage for goods transportation, mainly focusing on transit-related risks. However, they usually do not cover comprehensive damage or loss coverage.</li>
<li><strong>Comprehensive Coverage:</strong> Packers and movers companies often offer comprehensive coverage that covers not only transit-related risks but also damage or loss caused during the transportation process. This type of coverage ensures a higher degree of protection for your belongings.</li>
<li><strong>IRDAI Marine Transit Insurance:</strong> IRDAI (Insurance Regulatory and Development Authority of India) Marine Transit Insurance provides a 100% declared-value coverage for goods transportation. This coverage ensures maximum protection for your valuable items, including accidental collision or unforeseen delays.</li>
</ul>

